  "_comment": "TinyS3[D] firmware-feature proxy on Wokwi's ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 board. The runtime build matches the virtual DevKitC Arduino variant while enabling WMB+'s TinyS3[D] feature macros. GPIO17/18 and the MAX17048/LIS2DW12 wiring are available; MAX17048 ALRT follows the TinyS3[D] GPIO10 mapping. Wokwi's DevKitC does NOT expose GPIO33, so USB power sense is deliberately remapped to GPIO35 and tied high; this exercises the logic but cannot catch a wrong physical GPIO33 mapping. GAP: RF_ANTENNA_SWITCH_PIN (38) remains unconnected and unobservable. serialInterface=USB_SERIAL_JTAG selects Wokwi's documented ESP32-S3 USB CDC monitor path. This is not a TinyS3[D] board or electrical model."
